From ec45ffd701c9f871a9624bc78c7beb19c3c2a48b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 04:31:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 0: sync engine skeleton (Rust), MD3 UI shell,
 architecture docs

- Rust workspace: seams-proto (wire protocol + version vectors), seams-identity
  (Ed25519 device identity with cert-fingerprint device IDs), seams-sync (scanner,
  blake3 hashing, folder index, three-way conflict decisions, 14-day trash),
  seams-discovery (mDNS announcements), seams-transport (QUIC with mutual
  certificate pinning), seams-core (config + node facade). 26 unit tests green.
- Android: project moved into android/, Material 3 screens (Devices / Folders /
  Conflicts), adaptive navigation, local-network permissions, minSdk 26
  (legacy launcher bitmaps dropped).
- Docs: ARCHITECTURE.md (design, protocol draft, roadmap) and CONFLICTS.md
  (conflict specification).
